,"g":"meme","k":["freehand","16-segments","novel-curve"],"s":{"kind":"custom","points":[{"x":0,"multiple":1},{"x":0.125,"multiple":1.36},{"x":0.25,"multiple":1.86},{"x":0.375,"multiple":2.54},{"x":0.5,"multiple":3.46},{"x":0.625,"multiple":4.73},{"x":0.75,"multiple":6.45},{"x":0.875,"multiple":8.8},{"x":1,"multiple":12}]}},"data":""},{"config":"6QyJH13S33qiwVrsd1Atmw9ZUCWyWbNekjYkz2cBcxUF","author":"4yDcss3jDoQtrsACaTFvDoG4Zzo6ePAbkZin4gHYHetK","signature":"31wtNzSYceDeXi8p5JGnCfyqDbShrG6qgkR1tqovK8yPU1JpXQvcUtcm7sFmeA6GVfHwsHSS8PnZxPURsHaQEp6z","blockTime":1791214275,"meta":{"v":1,"c":"6QyJH13S33qiwVrsd1Atmw9ZUCWyWbNekjYkz2cBcxUF","n":"Micro Speedrun","t":"Graduate a token into DAMM v2 with a single devnet wallet","d":"Fair Meme mechanics with a 0.4 SOL raise, built with the Studio's raise solver. A judge or tester with one devnet wallet and under a SOL can launch, buy to graduation, crank the migration into DAMM v2 and claim both author and creator fees.","g":"experimental","k":["demo","devnet","one-wallet"],"s":{"kind":"constant-product"}},"data":""},{"config":"CQehaMkqh4Aaah2KnXXSvuhEPsjSNRjnknxF5mRR3LPg","author":"4yJTGbhm1BwVGxs1ViKb3wteGayEP5HgNgycPRAQm55E","signature":"62wES1tXdjHv7XRpwH3VBLrDE56Z3cTttStAQzRsghkJUWh79pU2Jw4DEu4Mh8Gpqskcamqizwcf24sMKS7DGRCJ","blockTime":1791202743,"meta":{"v":1,"c":"CQehaMkqh4Aaah2KnXXSvuhEPsjSNRjnknxF5mRR3LPg","n":"Pocket S-Curve","t":"A 3 SOL S-curve for quick demos of the full lifecycle","d":"The S-Curve Discovery mechanics at demo scale: a 16-segment sigmoid with a 10% to 1% sniper fee over 30 seconds. Designed and published entirely from the Curvesmith Studio.","g":"experimental","k":["sigmoid","demo","devnet"],"s":{"kind":"sigmoid","steepness":9,"midpoint":0.5}},"data":""},{"config":"6WiKoynHRBM6xqgX9yn7dTm8pt3r8U8JSU4dTjU7WMmj","author":"4QXNsWvHhYkkxyWido55XapuZ9RigqHnx9zx5VNXS8S7","signature":"RgtpEf6FHq1mSmyHSCx4w7juJ4WVAYui34KxcPxRfeKoX41ovKm5h9v38De8wguPq8odWVj74KnsSVwfyPXveyw","blockTime":1791202057,"meta":{"v":1,"c":"6WiKoynHRBM6xqgX9yn7dTm8pt3r8U8JSU4dTjU7WMmj","n":"Speedrun","t":"A tiny 2 SOL raise to watch the full lifecycle in a minute","d":"Same mechanics as Fair Meme at 1/150th of the scale. Built for demos and testing: launch, buy, graduate to DAMM v2 and claim fees on devnet with a couple of airdropped SOL.","g":"experimental","k":["demo","devnet","full-lifecycle"],"s":{"kind":"constant-product"}},"data":""},{"config":"9FhtTihiN3TjXquVJEwy3fwDB72HKSpzZQrusAEnm97q","author":"4QXNsWvHhYkkxyWido55XapuZ9RigqHnx9zx5VNXS8S7","signature":"3H8MbybAYTtFa4594CJq4Fb13Jxmpo3G9SFN2GRXz8rYvcfmSkDoZKStcDM15pX9HCGRhwL7fDWnnKp65Z6eh2n7","blockTime":1791202056,"meta":{"v":1,"c":"9FhtTihiN3TjXquVJEwy3fwDB72HKSpzZQrusAEnm97q","n":"Creator Coin","t":"Early supporters rewarded first, creators paid on every trade","d":"A concave power curve (exponent 0.5): price rises fastest at the start, so the first supporters get the best entries without a winner-takes-all bottom. 70% of fees go to the creator. 5% creator allocation with a 90-day cliff.","g":"creator","k":["power-curve","creator-allocation","fee-share"],"s":{"kind":"power","exponent":0.5}},"data":""},{"config":"52mShCCoezWULK2HHDCnkrqwnHj26mGUy96CBcCuPLEx","author":"4QXNsWvHhYkkxyWido55XapuZ9RigqHnx9zx5VNXS8S7","signature":"244jRKqZpwhVDtjB43QCsqCwBc9SgaV3WaVjzVdN3EGXZ6osin59EXjDGd1hJwMZcf6rkTE77ZvncKKrWjnKdEdt","blockTime":1791202054,"meta":{"v":1,"c":"52mShCCoezWULK2HHDCnkrqwnHj26mGUy96CBcCuPLEx","n":"Agent Treasury","t":"Curve fees fund an AI agent's compute, forever","d":"Built for AI-agent tokens: 90% of curve trading fees and 100% of a 2% graduation fee go to the creator, which is the agent's own wallet. A linear curve keeps the agent's funding predictable. After graduation, the agent owns half of the LP (locked), so DAMM v2 trading fees keep paying for inference.","g":"ai","k":["creator-fees","migration-fee","linear"],"s":{"kind":"linear"}},"data":""},{"config":"Hd4fDRQrwPBowsNm6HGuttbAyRx8ThRdZaLV6gCkLtWs","author":"4QXNsWvHhYkkxyWido55XapuZ9RigqHnx9zx5VNXS8S7","signature":"2NgBpmTJN2qZ9DhJ535fWuvstNoddo6uNhxeyufjKzuR6gjGNW4VoAjnUzM7WwZgXPUGCSJsdEWvvhpLZm9Vvz12","blockTime":1791202052,"meta":{"v":1,"c":"Hd4fDRQrwPBowsNm6HGuttbAyRx8ThRdZaLV6gCkLtWs","n":"S-Curve Discovery","t":"Cheap accumulation, a fast middle, a calm run into graduation","d":"A sigmoid price path fitted with 16 segments: the first third of the sale barely moves the price, the middle reprices quickly, and the final stretch flattens so the graduation buyer is not the most exposed. Linear 25% to 0.8% fee decay over 90s.","g":"experimental","k":["sigmoid","16-segments","novel-curve"],"s":{"kind":"sigmoid","steepness":9,"midpoint":0.5}},"data":""},{"config":"GG1326dz6KQJ9Mry7KrnuL9uE1D6RBZbAtRC4a9GXTC4","author":"4QXNsWvHhYkkxyWido55XapuZ9RigqHnx9zx5VNXS8S7","signature":"5nXHjXLhfo3Xc9ca4gZaVUJDnsbC1QopVsYuPXzLrYSH9wfn8WWt3bujtQdffVdEz9RfW117W9pNoxezkcCaAkN","blockTime":1791202049,"meta":{"v":1,"c":"GG1326dz6KQJ9Mry7KrnuL9uE1D6RBZbAtRC4a9GXTC4","n":"Equity Tranches","t":"IPO-style book: four priced tranches, then a live market","d":"A stepped curve built from flat price bands: 40% of the float at $1.00, 30% at $1.25, 20% at $1.60, 10% at $2.00. Each tranche is a hard repricing, like book-building rounds, so early backers get a transparent discount instead of a lottery. 10% team allocation is locked for a year then vests monthly. Creator LP vests over 12 months.","g":"equity","k":["tranches","usdc","team-vesting","lp-vesting"],"s":{"kind":"tranches","bandBps":50,"tranches":[{"priceMultiple":1,"share":0.4},{"priceMultiple":1.25,"share":0.3},{"priceMultiple":1.6,"share":0.2},{"priceMultiple":2,"share":0.1}]}},"data":""},{"config":"BccbPGmMGC1ybgUdyUF7cWAg9jYebyuKamU3WhSwEPSJ","author":"4QXNsWvHhYkkxyWido55XapuZ9RigqHnx9zx5VNXS8S7","signature":"3yZq9dfoZoza3PaBuU9YZ7ezSAbqYUXFybf9fQTxwWaAEyenhSSUDyq3EGDMBwuraKdSieAa6EhWqUkvBf7j8pBt","blockTime":1791202047,"meta":{"v":1,"c":"BccbPGmMGC1ybgUdyUF7cWAg9jYebyuKamU3WhSwEPSJ","n":"NAV Subscription","t":"Fixed-price primary sale for tokenized funds and RWAs","d":"A flat curve: every unit sells within 1% of NAV ($1.00), like a fund subscription window. Fees are a flat 0.25% with no sniper tax because there is nothing to snipe. On completion the raise and units seed a USDC secondary market at NAV with a tight 0.25% pool fee. The issuer keeps metadata authority for disclosures.","g":"rwa","k":["flat","usdc","fixed-price","issuer-controlled"],"s":{"kind":"flat","bandBps":100}},"data":""},{"config":"75fBkb5WaHE8eMjQYP8wZSAEHgoDPj5CpotnsRizP19e","author":"4QXNsWvHhYkkxyWido55XapuZ9RigqHnx9zx5VNXS8S7","signature":"4cAFzHnRKoUitM76PUCaKMP3ktVkVsBqeAv5oxZeaPWaTPoJyViajzCngQfdK1fySeG7T4kkfUov6RL3ewRD1pCj","blockTime":1791202043,"meta":{"v":1,"c":"75fBkb5WaHE8eMjQYP8wZSAEHgoDPj5CpotnsRizP19e","n":"Long Curve","t":"Weeks of price discovery for communities, not minutes","d":"A 16-segment exponential curve over a 400x price range with a large raise, so graduation takes sustained demand. Low 0.6% fees and 80% of them go to the creator. After graduation the DAMM v2 fee starts at 2% and decays to 0.25% as market cap grows 10x. Creator LP vests over six months.","g":"community","k":["exponential","16-segments","mcap-fee-scheduler","lp-vesting"],"s":{"kind":"exponential"}},"data":""},{"config":"GJ3nd3yuZ4cFkCMSuhwsvbdXKUHxzKUcdsSqkcQaoJRJ","author":"4QXNsWvHhYkkxyWido55XapuZ9RigqHnx9zx5VNXS8S7","signature":"3EvT86QWiAJ9Q2FvxHTH7mFwBu1ytdwDYANBb2ohB3FQCg2NWVsw1rPvKasonAWhRPVL5tBSYfybjPKw6BKNd4Ze","blockTime":1791201993,"meta":{"v":1,"c":"GJ3nd3yuZ4cFkCMSuhwsvbdXKUHxzKUcdsSqkcQaoJRJ","n":"Fair Meme","t":"Pump-style curve with a sniper tax that melts in two minutes","d":"Classic single-segment constant-product curve. A 50% fee in the first seconds decays exponentially to 1% over 120s, so bots fund the creator instead of farming them. The creator's bundled first buy pays the minimum fee. All graduated liquidity is permanently locked.","g":"meme","k":["anti-sniper","loc